### Weekend Package add-ons. Prices are per person, in pesewas.
### The four creates below seed the options priced in the event brief. The
### other listed accommodations (Edibec Guest House, Afua Anoa Apartment,
### Atlantic Hotel, Raybow International Hotel) need prices before they can be
### added.

### Create KOD Apartment — 3 sharing (admin)
# @name createKodTriple
POST {{baseUrl}}/add-ons
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "accommodation",
  "provider": "KOD Apartment",
  "name": "Triple room",
  "occupancy": 3,
  "price": 15000
}

### Create KOD Apartment — 2 sharing (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/add-ons
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "accommodation",
  "provider": "KOD Apartment",
  "name": "Double room",
  "occupancy": 2,
  "price": 22500
}

### Create KOD Apartment — single occupancy (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/add-ons
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "accommodation",
  "provider": "KOD Apartment",
  "name": "Single room",
  "occupancy": 1,
  "price": 45000
}

### Create return group transport (admin)
# @name createTransport
POST {{baseUrl}}/add-ons
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "transport",
  "name": "Return group transportation",
  "price": 25000
}

@addOnId = {{createKodTriple.response.body.data.id}}
@transportId = {{createTransport.response.body.data.id}}

### List bookable add-ons (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/add-ons

### List all add-ons including inactive (admin view)
GET {{baseUrl}}/add-ons?activeOnly=false

### Get add-on
GET {{baseUrl}}/add-ons/{{addOnId}}

### Update add-on — cap bookings and change price (admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/add-ons/{{addOnId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "capacity": 30,
  "price": 15000
}

### Deactivate add-on (admin) — use this once it has bookings
PUT {{baseUrl}}/add-ons/{{addOnId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### Delete add-on (admin) — only when nobody has booked it
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/add-ons/{{addOnId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Participants who booked an add-on (e.g. a hotel's guest list)
GET {{baseUrl}}/participants?addOnId={{addOnId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
